Package: com.kolby.swiftpeek
Name: SwiftPeek
Depends: mobilesubstrate, preferenceloader
Version: 0.5.1
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64
Description: Read-only SwiftUI + window-tree inspector. 0.5.1 makes the view-walk depth, node budget and a focus class settable, so a dump can reach the view that actually paints a colour instead of stopping in the transition-view scaffolding above it. Layer and gradient colour reported since 0.5.0. No hooks, no FOVO, every target defaults off. Debug tooling; not published.
Maintainer: ma6x9x
Author: ma6x9x
Section: Tweaks

